  {
   "key": "next_step",
   "title": "Possible next steps",
   "text": "A good first step could be reaching out to the MPS Society in the United Kingdom, a patient group the atlas links to MPS I (Hurler) [E7291dc8, E8f47d8d, E9d36bfe]. Another step could be contacting the Canadian Society for Mucopolysaccharide & Related Diseases, another patient group linked to MPS I (Hurler) [E49f99f7, E44322d5]. A third step could be contacting AIMPS ETS in Italy, also linked to MPS I (Hurler) in the atlas [E68fcb3d]. These groups may be able to offer support, information, and connections to others with the same condition, so it could help to ask your child's care team about reaching out to them [E7291dc8, E49f99f7, E68fcb3d].",
